      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì shí yí yuè èr shí hào xīng qī liù zǎo shang liù diǎn sì shí wǔ fēn wǒ zài shuì jiào mā ma zài dǎ diàn huà gěi bà ba",
      "english": "Today was November 20th, Saturday. At 6:45 in the morning, I was sleeping, and Mom was calling Dad."
