      "traditional": "“西西，你說，你的爸爸為什麼不給我打電話？”媽媽每天早上都會吃早飯，但是她今天沒有吃早飯。",
      "pinyin": "xī xī nǐ shuō nǐ de bà ba wèi shén me bù gěi wǒ dǎ diàn huà mā ma měi tiān zǎo shang dōu huì chī zǎo fàn dàn shì tā jīn tiān méi yǒu chī zǎo fàn",
      "english": "“Xixi, tell me, why is your dad not calling me?” Mom ate breakfast every day, but she did not eat breakfast today."
