    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Phone Call Came",
      "",
      "Today was November 20th, Saturday. At 6:45 in the morning, I was sleeping, and Mom was calling Dad.",
      "Dad was not inside the computer.",
      "The day before yesterday, yesterday, and today Dad was not inside the computer. Where did Dad go?",
      "",
      "“Xixi, tell me, why is your dad not calling me?” Mom ate breakfast every day, but she did not eat breakfast today.",
      "Mom was very unhappy.",
      "",
      "At 6:45 every morning I would be asleep, but today I was not asleep.",
      "I was in front of Mom, looking at Mom. I thought: I cannot sleep. I need to talk to Mom. This way, Mom can be happier.",
      "",
      "Mom was studying, but she did not want to study. I knew that Mom wanted Dad to call her.",
      "I also wanted Dad to call her; this way Mom would be happy. I wanted Mom to be happy.",
      "",
      "Just then, a phone call came. Was it a phone call from Dad?",
      ""
    ]
  }
